# SEIS Public Readiness Rule
- Keep setup and validation instructions current and runnable.
- Demo should work without API keys by default.
- Broken routes/assets are release blockers and must be tracked.
- Use explicit state labels: mock/planned/real/disabled.
- Ensure no secrets are committed and no private data is exposed.
- Preserve backward-safe public docs for onboarding and contribution.
